        <h3>Halal status</h3>
        <p class="eyebrow">What they claim</p>
        <p>Zabiha meat is halal. Non-zabiha is generally haram.</p>
        <p class="eyebrow hot">What we reject</p>
        <p>A binary religious grade does not belong on a civic meat supply. Inspected is the public word. Permitted-by-fiqh is a private one.</p>
      </article>
<article>
        <h3>Slaughter method</h3>
